  <para style="h">Akpa Ñwed Tesalonia</para>
  <para style="toc1">Akpa Ñwed Tesalonia</para>
  <para style="toc2">Akpa Ñwed Tesalonia</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Tes</para>
  <para style="mt1">Akpa Ñwed Tesalonia</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TH 1" />
  <para style="s1">Ekọọm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 1:1" />Ami Pọọl, Sailas ye Timoti, inọọ etob ami esọk ufọkabasi mbon Tesalọnika ke Abasi Ete ye Abọọñ Yisọs Krais. Mfọn ye emem aba ye ndufo.<verse eid="1TH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Ukọọm Abasi Mbaña Mbuọdidem Mbon Tesalọnika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 1:2" />Ñnyịn imisikọọm Abasi afịd ini ke ntak afịd ndufo, inyʌñ isịn afịd ndufo ke akam ñnyịn. <verse eid="1TH 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 1:3" />Ñnyịn imisitoiyo ndufo afịd ini ke iso Abasi Ete ke abaña utom ndufo a-atooho mbuọdidem, akpọsọñ utom ndufo e-enamma ke ima, ye ime a-ndufo enieghe ke ntak idodanyen ke Abọọñ ñnyịn Yisọs Krais.<verse eid="1TH 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 1:4" />Sia ñnyịn imidiọọñọ, mme nditọeka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke usem Greek adelfọi a-awuọñọke </char><char style="fq" closed="false">nditọeka </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ideen ye ibaan </char><char style="ft" closed="false">anyʌñ asʌk ada anọ mme ideen ye ibaan e-enịmme Krais ke akpanikọ ke atu ubon Abasi; se ñko ke 1 Tesalonia 2:1, 9, 14, 17; 1 Tesalonia 3:7; 1 Tesalonia 4:1, 10, 13; 1 Tesalonia 5:1, 4, 12, 14, 25, 27.</char></note> ke Krais A-Abasi a-amaaha, ke anye imek ndufo, <verse eid="1TH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 1:5" />sia eti etob ñnyịn ikisañake ye ikọ inua ikpọọñ, ado ye adudu ñko, ye Adisana Sịbidịd ye adinekke nnịm ke akpanikọ. Ndufo emediọọñọ naña ñnyịn ikidu uwem ke atu ndufo ke ntak ndufo. <verse eid="1TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 1:6" />Ndufo emaikpebe ñnyịn ye Abọọñ, sia ke unana adikere mbana akpọsọñ ndutʌhọ ndufo, emaebọ etob ke inemesịd A-Adisana Sịbidịd anọọhọ. <verse eid="1TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 1:7" />Ke ntoro ndufo emaekappa edoñño uwọdñkpọ enọ afịd mme andinịm ke akpanikọ ke Masidonia ye ke Akaya. <verse eid="1TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 1:8" />Etob Abọọñ amaatop awuọ ito ndufo, idooho ke Masidonia ikpọọñ ye Akaya, ado e-ekop etob mbuọdidem ndufo ke Abasi ke afịd itie. Ke ntoro, ñnyịn inieghe ñkpọ ndomokeed aba se itañ ibaña anye, <verse eid="1TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 1:9" />sia ammọ ke idem ammọ e-enọ mbʌk se ikitịppe ke utọ adidaara a-ndufo ekidaarake ñnyịn. Ammọ e-etañ naña ndufo ekekappa ekeene Abasi, ekpọñ mme usọsọiñkpọ, enyʌñ enam ñkpọ enọ aduuwem Abasi akpanikọ, <verse eid="1TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 1:10" />ndin ebet Ayịn amọ a-atooho hefịn, a-anye akenamma aset ke ñkpa, a-adooho Yisọs, i-inyaañake ñnyịn asio ke ekamba ifiobesịd a-adiidi.<verse eid="1TH 1:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TH 2" />
  <para style="s1">Utom Abasi a-Pọọl Anamma ke Tesalonia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 2:1" />Ndufo emediọọñọ, nditọeka ke Krais, ke adidi ñnyịn ndise ndufo ikidooho utak-utak. <verse eid="1TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 2:2" />Ñnyịn imaibọ ufen ye usọñanyen ke Filipai, naña ndufo imaidiọọñọ, ado ke unwam Abasi, ñnyịn imainie uko adisuan eti etob ikọ Abasi ikereke akpọsọñ ubiọọñọ. <verse eid="1TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 2:3" />Sia ebeeñe a-ñnyịn inamma itooho ke ndudue me ke idiọọk akikere, inyʌññọ ido nte ñnyịn iyem adibabiaña ndufo. <verse eid="1TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 2:4" />Utu ke ado, ñnyịn itañ ikọ nte mbon A-Abasi amaakenyịmme adiyaak eti etob Abasi nsịn ke ubọk. Ñnyịn inwanake adinem awo esịd, ado inwana adinem Abasi a-adomoke esịd ñnyịn ase. <verse eid="1TH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 2:5" />Abasi ado ntiense ke ndufo emediọọñọ ke akenaanam ñnyịn ikamake nnem inua, inyʌñọ ifʌhọ ñkpọ ke iso iben mfʌk idiọọk itọñ ñnyịn. <verse eid="1TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 2:6" />Ñnyịn ikiyemme itooro ito awo, ikiyemme ito ndufo me awo mfen ndomokeed, akpesʌkado nte mme abọsịd Krais, ñnyịn ikpaikiwọt adudu ñnyịn. <verse eid="1TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 2:7" />Ado ñnyịn ikiba nte ntəkayịn ke atu ndufo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TH 2:7">Kpa naña eka nditọ ase ntəkayịn amọ. <verse eid="1TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 2:8" />Ñnyịn imaima ndufo eti-eti, anam ñnyịn ima inem esịd adiwuana ye ndufo, idooho eti etob Abasi ikpọọñ, ado uwem ñnyịn ñko. <verse eid="1TH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 2:9" />Ke akpanikọ ndufo emetoiyo, nditọeka ke Krais, akpọsọñ utom ye ufen ñnyịn. Ñnyịn ikinam utom akonayio ye uweemeayio mbaak ñnyịn idido mbiomo inọọ awo ndomokeed ke idaha a-ñnyịn ikwọrọke eti etob Abasi inọọ ndufo. <verse eid="1TH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 2:10" />Ndufo edoñño ntiense, ntoro ke Abasi ado ñko, ke naña ñnyịn ikisana, inen, inyʌñ inana ndo ke atu ndufo e-ekenịmme ke akpanikọ. <verse eid="1TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 2:11" />Sia ndufo emediọọñọ ke ñnyịn ikinam ñkpọ ye ndufo keedekeed nte ete anam ñkpọ ye nditọ amọ, <verse eid="1TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 2:12" />ke adisọọñọ ndufo idem, inọọ ndufo ndọñesịd inyʌñ ikpeiye ndufo adidu uwem a-asañake akekem ke se Abasi ayem, anye i-ikoodo ndufo asịn ke abio ubọọñ ye itooro amọ.<verse eid="1TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 2:13" />Ndin ñnyịn isʌk ikaaka iso ikọọm Abasi ye ntak, sia ke ini ndufo ekebọọhọ ikọ Abasi, a-ndufo ekekoppo ito ñnyịn, ndufo ikibọọhọ nte ikọ awo, ado ekebọ nte ikọ Abasi, a-anamma utom ke atu ndufo e-enịmme ke akpanikọ. <verse eid="1TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 2:14" />Sia ndufo, nditọeka ke Krais, emaekappa edoñño mme andikpebe mme ufọkabasi ke Yudia, e-ebaaha ke Krais Yisọs. Ndufo emaebọ ufen eto ubọk mbon abio ndufo, ukem ufen se mme ufọkabasi ekebọọ eto mme Yuu, <verse eid="1TH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 2:15" />e-ekewotto Abọọñ Yisọs ye mme prọfed enyʌñ ibịn ñnyịn esioñño. Ammọ inemme Abasi esịd, enyʌñ eba utọk-utọk ye afịd awo <verse eid="1TH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 2:16" />ke ammọ aditre ñnyịn aditañ ikọ nnọọ mme Gentile nọ ato do ammọ enie adinyaaña. Ke usʌñ ntom ke ammọ enam mme idiọọkñkpọ akaaka iso atọt. Ifiobesịd Abasi adisịm ammọ ke akpatre.<verse eid="1TH 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Udọñ Pọọl Adikise Mbon Tesalonia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 2:17" />Nditọeka ke Krais, ke ini ekibakkake ñnyịn esio ikpọñ ndufo ke etək ibio ini (ke abʌkidem, idooho ke akikere), ñnyịn imainie ataa ekamba udọñ inyʌñ idomo afịd ukeme adikịt ndufo. <verse eid="1TH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 2:18" />Sia ñnyịn imaiyem adidi ibịne ndufo. Ke akpanikọ, ami Pọọl, mmaayem adinam ntoro uwak ini, ado Setan amaabiọọñọ usʌñ ñnyịn. <verse eid="1TH 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 2:19" />Sia nsoo ido idodanyen ñnyịn, idadesịd ñnyịn, me anyanya a-ñnyịn idiibọ ubọọñ ke iso Abọọñ ñnyịn Yisọs Krais ke anye amaadi? Nte idooho ndufo? <verse eid="1TH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 2:20" />Ke akpanikọ ndufo edo ubọọñ ye idaara ñnyịn.<verse eid="1TH 2:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TH 3" />
  <para style="s1">Etob Nsọọñọnda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 3:1" />Ndin sia ñnyịn imiikanna iyọ aba, ñnyịn imaikere ke a-afọn ñnyịn adiba ke idem ñnyịn ke Aten. <verse eid="1TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 3:2" />Ñnyịn imaidọñ Timoti, a-adooho ayịneka ñnyịn ke Krais ye anam utom Abasi ke adisuan eti etob Krais, adisọọñọ anyʌñ idọñ ndufo esịd ke mbuọdidem ndufo, <verse eid="1TH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 3:3" />mbaak awo ndufo ndomokeed adiduọ ke mme idomo ami. Sia ndufo emenekke ediọọñọ ke emainịm ñnyịn enọ mme ñkpọ ami. <verse eid="1TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 3:4" />Ke akpanikọ, ke ini ñnyịn ikibaaha ye ndufo, ñnyịn imaikaiso aditañ inọọ ndufo ke eyaitʌkkọ ñnyịn. Ndin amaatịppe ñko, kpa nte ndufo etʌmmọ ediọọñọ. <verse eid="1TH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 3:5" />Ke ntak ami, ke ini ami mmiikikanna mme aba, mmaadọñ nte ebịp ebaña mbuọdidem ndufo. Ami mmaakop ndịk nte ke akeme ido andidomo idomo amaadidomo ndufo ke usʌñ akeedodo utom a-ñnyịn ikinamma akeme ikappa ndo utak-utak.<verse eid="1TH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Etob Idọñesịd Timoti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 3:6" />Ado Timoti a-ato ukañ ndufo adisịm ñnyịn, ndin anye a-adat eti etob adi abaña mbuọdidem ye ima ndufo. Anye a-atañ inọ ñnyịn ate ke afịd ini ndufo emenie ntiñkpọ se etoiyo ibaña ñnyịn ndin ndufo emeyem adikịt ñnyịn kpa naña ñnyịn ñko iyem adikịt ndufo. <verse eid="1TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 3:7" />Ke ami, nditọeka ke Krais, ke afịd nnananyen ye ndutʌhọ ñnyịn iminie idọñesịd ke ndufo ke ntak mbuọdidem ndufo. <verse eid="1TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 3:8" />Idahami, ñnyịn iminie ataa uwem, sia ndufo etʌmmọ enie iwuuk ke Abọọñ. <verse eid="1TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 3:9" />Die ke ñnyịn ikan adikọọm Abọọñ nọ akekem ke usiene idaara a-ñnyịn inieghe ke iso Abasi ke ntak ndufo? <verse eid="1TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 3:10" />Akonayio ye uweemeayio ñnyịn itʌm isịn ifịk ibọñ akam ite ñnyịn ikpikap ikịt ndufo akañ mfen nọ ato do ñnyịn isịn iyọhọ se inana ke mbuọdidem ndufo.<verse eid="1TH 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 3:11" />Ke ami, yak Abasi Ete ke idem amọ ye Abọọñ ñnyịn Yisọs anam usʌñ anwaña inọ ñnyịn adidi ibịne ndufo. <verse eid="1TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 3:12" />Yak Abasi anam ima ndufo aka iso atọt anyʌñ ayọhọ aduọi anọ emọ-emọ ye afịd mbon mfen ñko, kpa naña ñnyịn inie ima inọọ ndufo. <verse eid="1TH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 3:13" />Yak anye isọọñọ ndufo esịd nọ ndufo enana ndudue, ndin esana ke iso Abasi Ete ke ini Abọọñ ñnyịn Yisọs adiidi ye afịd mme ndisana awo amọ.<verse eid="1TH 3:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TH 4" />
  <para style="s1">Uwem A-anemme Abasi Esịd</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 4:1" />Ke akpatre nditọeka ke Krais, ñnyịn imaikpeep ndufo naña ekpesaña edu uwem nọ enem Abasi esịd, kpa naña ndufo edu idahami. Idahami ñnyịn ibeeñe ndufo inyʌñ ikpak ndufo ke Abọọñ Yisọs ite ekaka iso enam ntom. <verse eid="1TH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 4:2" />Sia ndufo emediọọñọ utọ ukpeebñkpọ a-ñnyịn ikinọọhọ ndufo ato ke adudu Abọọñ ñnyịn Yisọs.<verse eid="1TH 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 4:3" />Ado uduak Abasi nọ ndufo edoñño ndisana, nọ ndufo efeghe ekpọñ use ye efịbe; <verse eid="1TH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 4:4" />nọ awo keedekeed akpeep mfadidem ke usʌñ a-adooho adisana ye ke edu ukpono. <verse eid="1TH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 4:5" />Idooho ke akpọsọñ idiọọk itọñ nte mbon imiidiọọñọke Abasi; <verse eid="1TH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 4:6" />ndin ke ntak mme ñkpọ ami, yak awo ndomokeed akuudue ayịneka amọ ke Krais, me adinam anye idiọọkñkpọ. Abọọñ ayaamia mbon e-enamma utọ ñkpọ ami ufen, naña ñnyịn imaikitañ inyʌñ idʌt ndufo utọñ. <verse eid="1TH 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 4:7" />Sia Abasi ikikoodo ñnyịn nọ ididu ndedeghe uwem, ado akikoot ñnyịn nọ ididu adisana uwem. <verse eid="1TH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 4:8" />Ke ntoro, awo a-asịnne ewʌhọ ami isịnne awo, ado asịn Abasi a-anọọhọ Adisana Sịbidịd amọ.<verse eid="1TH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 4:9" />Idahami, ke abaña ima nditọeka ke Krais, ñnyịn inieghe adiwet inọọ ndufo, sia ndufo ke idem ndufo emaekpeep eto Abasi adima emọ-emọ. <verse eid="1TH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 4:10" />Ndin ke akpanikọ, ndufo emema afịd ubon Abasi ke Masidonia. Ado ñnyịn isʌk ikpaakpak ndufo, nditọete ke Krais, adisʌk ñkaaka iso nnam ntoro. <verse eid="1TH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 4:11" />Ndufo inie udọñ adidu ifuuro-ifuuro uwem. Ikiisịn anyen ke ñkpọ awo mfen, inyʌñ idat ubọk ndufo inam utom, kpa naña ñnyịn imaikidọkkọ ndufo, <verse eid="1TH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 4:12" />nọ ato do uwem ndufo ke usen ke usen anam mme awo ke esiin inọ ndufo ukpono, ñko mbaak ndufo idido mbiomo inọọ awo ndomokeed.<verse eid="1TH 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ñkpa mme Andinịm ke Akpanikọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 4:13" />Nditọeka ke Krais, ñnyịn iyemme ndufo edoñño akọi ke abaña mbon e-emaekekpaña, mbaak ndufo iditua nte mbon i-imiinieghe idodanyen. <verse eid="1TH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 4:14" />Sia ñnyịn iminịm ke Yisọs amaakpa anyʌñ aset ke ñkpa, ke ntoro, ñnyịn iminịm ke Abasi ayaadat Yisọs ye mbon e-ekpaññake ke anye idi. <verse eid="1TH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 4:15" />Ato ke ikọ Abọọñ ke idem amọ, ñnyịn itañ inọ ndufo ke akpanikọ ite ke ñnyịn isʌkkọ idodu uwem, i-isʌhọke tutu adidi Abọọñ, ke akpanikọ idiibemme mbon e-ekekpaññake iso. <verse eid="1TH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 4:16" />Sia Abọọñ ke idem amọ ayaasọiyọ ke hefịn adi, ye akpọsọñ uyio ewʌhọ, ye uyio ekamba enyere ye adukpoñ A-Abasi adatta akoot awo, ndin mme akpañkpa ke Krais eyaebemiso eset. <verse eid="1TH 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 4:17" />Ke ado amaaboiyo, eyainam ñnyịn i-isʌkkọ idodu uwem inyʌññọ isʌhọ, isoobo ye ammọ ke ntọñanyọñ nọ ato do ñnyịn isoobo ye Abọọñ ke afịm. Ke ntoro, ñnyịn iyaiba ye Abọọñ ke nsi-nsi. <verse eid="1TH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 4:18" />Ke ntoro, isọọñọ emọ-emọ idem ye mme ikọ ami.<verse eid="1TH 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TH 5" />
  <para style="s1">Usen Abọọñ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 5:1" />Mme nditọeka ke Krais, ke abaña mme ini ye mme usen afiọñ, ufọn ibaaha ñnyịn adiwet inọ ndufo. <verse eid="1TH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 5:2" />Sia ndufo emenekke ediọọñọ ke usen Abọọñ adiidi nte inọ ke akonayio. <verse eid="1TH 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 5:3" />Idaha a-mme awo ebooho “Emem ye ifuuro,” nsobo ayaasịm ammọ ke idaha keed, wap, nte ubiak uman asịm awonwaan a-asañake ye idịb, ndin ammọ idiibọkkọke.<verse eid="1TH 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 5:4" />Ado, nditọeka ke Krais, ndufo ibaaha ke ekịm nọ usen ado adiiwat ndufo nte inọ. <verse eid="1TH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 5:5" />Afịd ndufo edo nditọ unwana ye nditọ uweemeayio. Ñnyịn idooho nditọ akonayio me nditọ ekịm. <verse eid="1TH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 5:6" />Ndin, yak ñnyịn ikiiba nte mbon mfen, e-edaiyakedaiya, ado yak ñnyịn isuuhọ idem inyʌñ iba ke mbeeñe idem. <verse eid="1TH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 5:7" />Sia mbon se idaiya idab, edaiya ke akonayio, mbon se ukọd anaam, anaam ke akonayio. <verse eid="1TH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 5:8" />Ado sia ñnyịn idooho mbon ñnwaña usen, yak inie mfadidem, isịne mbuọdidem ye ima nte ukpeme ikpanesịd ye idodanyen adinyaaña nte itam ukwak. <verse eid="1TH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 5:9" />Sia Abasi ikimekke ñnyịn ibo idibọ ufen ifiobesịd, ado nọ idibọ adinyaaña a-atooho Abọọñ ñnyịn Yisọs Krais. <verse eid="1TH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 5:10" />Anye akekpa inọ ñnyịn nọ ato do, me ñnyịn ideedemme me idaadaiya, ñnyịn idʌñ keed ye anye. <verse eid="1TH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 5:11" />Ke ntoro, isọọñọ emọ-emọ idem inyʌñ isịn emọ-emọ inweek kpa naña ndufo enam idahami.<verse eid="1TH 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Akpatre Item</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 5:12" />Idahami, ñnyịn imikpeiye ndufo nditọeka ke Krais, ite enọ mbon e-enekkeke enam utom ke atu ndufo ukpono, mbon i-ikarake ndufo ke Abọọñ e-enyʌññọ inọọ ndufo item. <verse eid="1TH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 5:13" />Inọ ammọ ekamba ukpono ke ima ke ntak utom ammọ. Idu uwem ke emem ye emọ-emọ. <verse eid="1TH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 5:14" />Ndin ñnyịn imibeeñe ndufo, nditọeka ke Krais, ite edʌt mbon ifu ye mbon ntịme utọñ; idọñ mbon unana idodanyen esịd, inwam mbon se idem amem, inie ime ye afịd awo. <verse eid="1TH 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 5:15" />Ikịt ibo ke awo ndomokeed isioho emọ-emọ usiene idiọọk, ado inwana adinam eti ñkpọ nnọọ emọ-emọ ye mbon mfen ñko.<verse eid="1TH 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 5:16" />Idaara afịd ini, <verse eid="1TH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 5:17" />ibọñ akam afịd ini. <verse eid="1TH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 5:18" />Ikọọm Abasi ke afịd ñkpọ, sia ami ado uduak Abasi inọọ ndufo ke Krais Yisọs.<verse eid="1TH 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 5:19" />Ikiiyaak ikañ Sịbidịd anịme; <verse eid="1TH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 5:20" />ikiinyʌñ isịn mme brọfesi ke ndek. <verse eid="1TH 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TH 5:21" />Idomo afịd ñkpọ ise; inyʌñ imʌm se ifọn ikama. <verse eid="1TH 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TH 5:22" />Ifeghe ikpọñ afịd ñkpọ se ido idiọọk.<verse eid="1TH 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TH 5:23" />Yak Abasi ke idem amọ, Abasi emem, anam ndufo esana mfọn-mfọn. Yak afịd sịbidịd ndufo, ukpọñ ye abʌkidem ekuunie ndo ndomokeed ke adidi Abọọñ ñnyịn Yisọs Krais. <verse eid="1TH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TH 5:24" />Andikood ndufo ado anam akpanikọ, ndin anye ayaanam ami inọ ndufo.<verse eid="1TH 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TH 5:25" />Nditọeka ke Krais, ibọñ akam inọ ñnyịn.<verse eid="1TH 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1TH 5:26" />Ikọọm afịd ikọd Abasi ye adisana ntʌminua.<verse eid="1TH 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1TH 5:27" />Ami mmiikpeiye ndufo ke iso Abọọñ nte ekoot ñwed ami enọ afịd nditọete.<verse eid="1TH 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1TH 5:28" />Yak mfọn Abọọñ ñnyịn Yisọs Krais aba ye ndufo.<verse eid="1TH 5:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 5" />
</usx>